# 📄 PaperLens

## AI-Powered Research Paper Assistant

PaperLens is an AI-powered research paper assistant that helps users upload research papers and get meaningful insights from academic documents.

The project focuses on simplifying research paper understanding by combining a modern frontend interface with a backend processing system.

---

##  Features

-  Upload Research Papers (PDF)
- Process academic documents
- AI-powered paper analysis (Integration in progress)
- Extract useful insights from papers
- Fast and simple user interface

